  "intro": ["Off the coast of Shionari, there is a deep ocean trench.", "On still nights, they say, the bottom of the sea hums.", "Twelve years ago, the Isari Observatory down there went silent.", "--You open your eyes. It is still dark.", "The radio on your chest crackles with a rough voice.", "\"...Isari Three, respond. Isari Three...\"", {"text": "...You feel this is not the first time you have opened your eyes here.", "meta": "m_dead_any"}, {"text": "In your dream, the forest of bones had changed its shape a little.", "meta": "m_dead_f4"}, {"text": "> Depth 10,900 m. Check remaining oxygen.", "nometa": "m_dead_any"}, {"text": "> Depth 10,900 m. Previous dive log loaded.", "meta": "m_dead_any", "nometa": "m_copy"}, {"text": "> Depth 10,900 m. Copy No. {n}, online.", "meta": "m_copy", "nometa": "cleared_true"}, {"text": "> Previous ascent confirmed. ...Abnormal swell on the sea surface.", "meta": "cleared_normal", "nometa": "cleared_true"}, {"text": "> The clock reads 03:18.", "meta": "cleared_true"}],
